Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.34,0:01:56.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What? They ran\Naway and left the island?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.27,0:01:57.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.36,0:01:59.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We couldn't even give them our gift.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.61,0:02:01.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How disappointing.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.32,0:02:04.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And after all they did for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.07,0:02:07.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they realize how\Nmuch we appreciate them.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.47,0:02:10.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.93,0:02:12.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They don't know how we feel.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.77,0:02:19.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, Aisa, it's not fair\Nthat you were the only one
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.06,0:02:20.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that got to say goodbye to them.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.98,0:02:24.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone's really upset that we\Nlet our heroes just run away.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.90,0:02:29.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry! Luffy and the others made\Nme promise to keep it a secret!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.38,0:02:32.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.13,0:02:34.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy can stretch his body really far!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.93,0:02:37.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's like a "Gum-Gum Pistol!"\NKapow! Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.80,0:02:40.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aisa, please! You've got to hold still!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.64,0:02:44.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never knew there were warriors\Nlike him in the Blue Sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.19,0:02:46.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanna be just\Nlike him when I grow up.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.52,0:02:47.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A Gum-Gum warrior!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.61,0:02:51.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aisa.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.32,0:02:52.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.49,0:02:54.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to\Ntrim your hair a little.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.36,0:02:56.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You need to let it grow.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.24,0:02:56.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.99,0:02:58.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, it'll look good.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.76,0:03:01.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think you've forgotten you're\Na girl, and girls should look cute.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.68,0:03:04.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Cute? Me?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.56,0:03:06.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.64,0:03:08.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.04,0:03:12.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}With the war over, there's no need for\Nkids like you to carry weapons anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.57,0:03:20.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Now you can enjoy life the way it was\Nmeant to be and as a proper young lady.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.66,0:03:23.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never knew you were so ladylike!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.49,0:03:26.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, Aisa! Now hold still!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.66,0:03:27.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Laki's ladylike!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.87,0:03:28.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aisa!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.20,0:03:38.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great Warrior Kalgara.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.87,0:03:43.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were told that the Shandorians'\Nrole has been fulfilled.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.93,0:03:48.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As for your last wish it was\Ndelivered to your best friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.90,0:03:52.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our future generations will\Nno longer have to shed blood.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.69,0:03:55.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We are finally at peace.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.11,0:03:56.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The war may be over.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.69,0:03:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But one thing that will\Nnever end is our pride!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.24,0:04:03.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please continue to guide us, Mighty\NKalgara, and watch over us as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.24,0:04:09.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We solemnly swear, The Fire\Nof Shandora will never die!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.70,0:04:21.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-I cannot abandon my duties!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.75,0:04:23.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am the Sky Knight, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.71,0:04:25.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should\Nbe looking at yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.81,0:04:28.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Remember, this city originally\Nbelonged to your people.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.55,0:04:31.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It did, long ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.51,0:04:33.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that means nothing now.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.73,0:04:37.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In fact, with this battle, all\Nof us realized something.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.14,0:04:39.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vearth belongs to no group.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.02,0:04:40.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It must be shared.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.92,0:04:43.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our world has two sides.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.30,0:04:45.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The land is called Skypiea.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.38,0:04:47.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The city, Shandora.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.46,0:04:50.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They have been torn\Nasunder by war for ages.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.45,0:04:55.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Only a man who has long lamented that\Nwar can unite them, and that man is you.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.07,0:04:59.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So Sky Knight, Gan Fall.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.53,0:05:02.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to take\NSkypiea's throne again.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.36,0:05:07.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only you can heal the deep wounds\Nthat scar this land of ours.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.60,0:05:09.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'd like you to do it, too, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.23,0:05:10.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gan Fall, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.52,0:05:14.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We Shandorians are behind\Nyou all the way Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.07,0:05:15.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gan Fall!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.57,0:05:16.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our god!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.57,0:05:17.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.28,0:05:22.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.32,0:05:25.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And here I was thinking\Nthat I'd finally be able
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.87,0:05:29.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to get some rest and\Ntend to my pumpkin patch.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.36,0:05:57.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay! We're almost there!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.28,0:06:00.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone! See that up ahead?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.37,0:06:01.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's Cloud End!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.58,0:06:02.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa, lemme see!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.87,0:06:04.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.66,0:06:06.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that's where we go back down from?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.93,0:06:09.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We got here sooner than I thought.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.27,0:06:13.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aww. We really have to go back already?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.11,0:06:17.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, it sounds crazy, but I'm\Nactually gonna miss this place.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.91,0:06:20.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think it's time we said\Ngoodbye to the White Sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.45,0:06:22.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sky island sure is fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.62,0:06:24.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But scary, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.54,0:06:27.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We just go through that gate,\Nand there'll be a Milky Road that'll take us
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.25,0:06:29.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the Blue Sea, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.75,0:06:32.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wonder if we'll ever\Nvisit this place again.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.21,0:06:34.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you never know.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.20,0:06:45.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but this\Nis as far as we can go!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.95,0:06:47.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, my friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.20,0:06:48.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourselves!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.84,0:06:49.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Suu!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.54,0:06:51.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We will! Thanks for the escort!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.70,0:06:54.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis! Don't forget me, angel!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.50,0:06:56.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to the others for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.90,0:06:58.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.55,0:07:00.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was nice meeting you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.80,0:07:02.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.72,0:07:05.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! You've got it wrong!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.10,0:07:08.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who\Nshould be thanking you!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.27,0:07:09.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll never forget you!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.81,0:07:11.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you all!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.23,0:07:13.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Conis, old guy, furball!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.32,0:07:14.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take care now!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.19,0:07:15.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Bye!\N– Bye!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.19,0:07:16.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now take in your sails,\Nand hold on tight!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.83,0:07:19.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're in for a bumpy ride!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.74,0:07:22.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right! Let's do as the man says!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.24,0:07:24.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It feels like we're\Nalready picking up speed!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.24,0:07:28.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we're sliding down from\Nthousands of feet in the air! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.09,0:07:29.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Aye!\N– Aye!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.09,0:07:30.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.19,0:07:35.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the...?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.14,0:07:40.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He says, "Don't leave without me."
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.42,0:07:41.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.67,0:07:43.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the Southbird we\Nbrought up here with us.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.46,0:07:51.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain! It looks like the log pose has\Nthe coordinates for the next island!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.68,0:07:55.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great! Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.39,0:07:58.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once we get to the bottom, we're\Ngonna start a brand-new adventure!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.69,0:08:00.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's up for finding some gold?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.77,0:08:02.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys! Get ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.78,0:08:07.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Blue Sea, here we come!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.62,0:08:08.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Aye!\N– Aye!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.80,0:08:24.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone grab hold of something!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.01,0:08:26.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The freefall's about to start!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.30,0:08:45.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just hang on!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.46,0:08:49.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One Octopus Balloon, on the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.75,0:09:24.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A balloon!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.54,0:09:27.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Ain't it great?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.00,0:09:28.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're not falling!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.37,0:09:29.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, good!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.67,0:09:31.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For a minute there,\NI thought we were goners!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.92,0:09:33.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.55,0:10:02.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keep ringing it!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.16,0:10:07.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let the departing heroes of this land\Nknow how much we appreciate them!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.04,0:10:08.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heso!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.54,0:10:13.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Come back soon!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.63,0:10:15.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're always welcome!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.34,0:10:16.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.84,0:10:19.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We wish you\Nsafe passage to the Blue Sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.11,0:10:29.61,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,When you look up, you see the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.81,0:10:33.41,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,Though some believe\Nit to be only a legend,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.41,0:10:37.37,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,there is an island floating\Nthousands of feet in the air.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.12,0:10:41.04,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,If you listen carefully,\Nyou can hear the tolling of a bell.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.10,0:10:45.88,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,It rings today, and it\Nwill ring again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.88,0:10:51.18,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,That bell rings from the heavens,\Nfrom a land that wandered.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.18,0:10:53.76,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,It sings of its pride, and proclaims
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.76,0:10:58.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the rest of the world,\N"We are here."
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.23,0:11:01.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is so great!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.79,0:11:03.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.12,0:11:05.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a way to travel! I love it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.15,0:11:10.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're calling off the search?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.33,0:11:12.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.79,0:11:14.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold has been\Nin the sky this whole time.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.83,0:11:17.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else to be\Nfound at the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.54,0:11:21.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, fellas. This dream's over.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.02,0:11:23.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No point in staying here anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.27,0:11:24.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Old man.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.75,0:11:26.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cricket.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.90,0:11:31.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I wanna thank all of you for helping me\Npursue my dream for all of these years.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.14,0:11:33.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You never stopped believing.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.23,0:11:34.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That means a lot.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.21,0:11:35.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does this mean...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.54,0:11:38.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...you're leaving the Alliance?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.17,0:11:39.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.59,0:11:44.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Since this dream's done, which\None are we gonna pursue next?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.90,0:11:54.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll all follow you to\Nthe ends of the earth, Old Man!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.70,0:11:55.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.72,0:12:03.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Gold! Gold! Gold! Gold!\N– Gold! Gold! Gold! Gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.06,0:12:05.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We finally struck it rich!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.77,0:12:08.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What should we buy with all this loot?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.10,0:12:11.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! I know! A huge bronze statue!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.31,0:12:12.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.61,0:12:14.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only an idiot would\Nexchange gold for bronze!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.65,0:12:15.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.78,0:12:17.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What we need are more cannons!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.53,0:12:19.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ten of them! Ten!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.03,0:12:21.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, I want to buy\Na refrigerator with a lock!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.51,0:12:22.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.21,0:12:23.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you get one with a lock,\Nthere'll be no way
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.65,0:12:25.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for me to get a midnight snack!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.98,0:12:28.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's exactly why I want one, you pig!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.36,0:12:30.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would you guys just hold on a second?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.78,0:12:32.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to land first.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.32,0:12:34.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then we can divide up the treasure.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.41,0:12:36.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please buy me books!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.79,0:12:40.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we buy everything you guys want,\Nwe're gonna be broke again in no time.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.62,0:12:52.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sun's completely set now.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.00,0:12:53.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's still a nice view.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.53,0:12:56.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right. It really is.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.58,0:13:12.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Agh! That's cold!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.25,0:13:14.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Robin! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.04,0:13:19.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was really scary!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.00,0:13:20.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened to the octopus?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.63,0:13:22.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess it ran out of air.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.38,0:13:24.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wonder how that happened.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.09,0:13:29.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.05,0:13:31.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't whine.\NWe did make it down here alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.64,0:13:32.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.41,0:13:39.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And we got to see an incredible place.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.38,0:13:44.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that we're down\Nhere, it looks so far away.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.01,0:13:46.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like something out of a dream.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.84,0:13:48.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a dreamland.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.64,0:13:50.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think we'll see it again?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.34,0:13:53.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you might see some\Nplace similar when you die.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.08,0:13:53.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not you.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.96,0:13:56.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I doubt you're going any place good!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.04,0:13:57.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.38,0:13:59.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys keep discussing the afterlife.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.86,0:14:02.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me? I'm gonna go\Nput on a pot of coffee.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.12,0:14:03.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make dinner instead, Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.83,0:14:05.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you ever not hungry?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have some coffee first\Nand be patient, will ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.55,0:14:09.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,pirate treasure is always divided up.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.63,0:14:11.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even after splitting up the loot,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.34,0:14:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we'd all have more gold than\Nwe'd know what to do with.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.68,0:14:18.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ones that that'll teach me all about
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.06,0:14:21.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the latest medical\Nprocedures and operations!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.44,0:14:23.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I wanna buy a bunch\Nof new medical books!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.38,0:14:26.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,New pots, frying pans,\Nsilverware, giant mousetrap...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.10,0:14:30.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow, even after all that,\Nthere'll still be a lot left over.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.37,0:14:32.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Right.\N– Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.86,0:14:32.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I could buy lotsa booze.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.42,0:14:35.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But first, I take an\Nextra cut: 80 percent!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.67,0:14:37.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Are you nuts?!\N– Are you nuts?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.17,0:14:38.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.84,0:14:41.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Then who? And why\Nshould they receive a bigger
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.43,0:14:43.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,share than the rest of us, huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.01,0:14:46.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's for a special lady.\NWe're going to set aside
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.17,0:14:48.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the gold to pay for the\Nrepairs we need to make.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.96,0:14:52.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A lady? Oh, wait, you mean the Merry?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.10,0:14:53.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.69,0:14:56.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't it about time we paid her\Nback for all she's done for us?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.10,0:14:57.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, come to think of it,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.69,0:15:00.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the Going Merry has carried us\Nfor a long time now, hasn't she?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.90,0:15:04.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ever since I joined up and left\Nmy village in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.06,0:15:07.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that's exactly why we need\Nto give her some tender, loving care.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.44,0:15:11.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good idea!\NThe Going Merry's Great Repair!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.15,0:15:12.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.68,0:15:14.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here. Dig in.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.60,0:15:19.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Huh. I've been wondering how much longer\NUsopp's half-ass repairs were gonna last.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.90,0:15:21.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm a sniper, not a shipwright!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.92,0:15:25.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. It's time we took\Nthe Merry to a real shipyard,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.04,0:15:29.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}and got some honest-to- goodness shipwrights\Nto give her the repairs she needs.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.95,0:15:32.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, there are people who can\Nfix ships better than Usopp?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.43,0:15:36.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Yep! Sometimes when you need a job done\Nright, you've gotta go see a professional!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.68,0:15:38.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.58,0:15:40.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've gotta get a\Nshipwright for our crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.52,0:15:43.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our journey's far from over, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.56,0:15:45.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Mm.\N– Mm.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.31,0:15:47.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We really need\Nsomeone with those skills.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.76,0:15:50.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the Merry isn't just our ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.12,0:15:51.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's our home, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.97,0:15:55.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So let's go find us a shipwright\Nwho can keep the Merry safe!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.80,0:15:59.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.61,0:16:01.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa. He got to the point.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.46,0:16:03.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's pretty rare.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.04,0:16:06.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, that sounds really good\Nto me, Luffy! Let's go do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.22,0:16:07.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh... That's what I just said!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.03,0:16:10.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just hope we can find somebody good!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We should get a musician, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.06,0:16:13.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's forget that one.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.04,0:16:22.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's all the ruckus out here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.67,0:16:24.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.16,0:16:27.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit pushing! C'mon! Stop it! Lemme go!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.20,0:16:28.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are they fighting?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.19,0:16:42.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.31,0:16:43.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sarquiss!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.83,0:16:45.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't someone gonna stop them?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.90,0:16:49.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No more! I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.84,0:16:51.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you making me do this?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.75,0:16:53.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.15,0:16:55.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen\NSarquiss plead like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.98,0:16:57.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why you ask?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.75,0:17:02.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why am I making you? Sarquiss. Bellamy.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.89,0:17:10.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm making you do this because you've made\Na mockery of this symbol. Heh heh heh...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.84,0:17:13.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does the Sky Island exist or not?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.10,0:17:17.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is the legendary\NCity of Gold real or not?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.86,0:17:22.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The truth doesn't\Nreally matter, now does it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.76,0:17:27.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You play the opposing sides off each\Nother, to twist them to your will.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.32,0:17:31.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what I told you. Right, Bellamy?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.16,0:17:35.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think that's, Don Quixote Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.45,0:17:38.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's one of\Nthe Seven Warlords of the Sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.08,0:17:40.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard his bounty's over 300 million.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.71,0:17:42.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's a guy like him doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.00,0:17:48.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You've really let me down and I've got\Nzero tolerance for useless punks like you.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.16,0:17:51.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Not again! My body's moving,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.89,0:17:57.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on its own, I can't\Ncontrol it! Please, nooooo!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.75,0:18:02.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Bellamy!\N– Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.06,0:18:08.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.16,0:18:09.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.39,0:18:12.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just give me one more\Nchance, to set things right.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.77,0:18:16.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I swear we will loyally\Nfollow your every command.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.81,0:18:17.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.91,0:18:19.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let it go, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.05,0:18:25.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I might've lost but I have never\Nonce acted against your principles.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.63,0:18:27.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I swear on your symbol! Please!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.96,0:18:30.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I had reasons for my actions!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.03,0:18:32.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I couldn't just let the\NStraw Hats get away.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.24,0:18:36.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They were bound to find you\Nsomeday if I didn't stop them!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.08,0:18:38.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh... What a touching sentiment.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.75,0:18:40.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Such genuine loyalty.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.72,0:18:45.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your concern for my well-being\Nis duly noted, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.26,0:18:49.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh heh heh... There's a\NNew Era quickly approaching,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.45,0:18:52.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so your actions here\Nwon't really matter.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.69,0:18:57.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, I still have no use for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.41,0:19:02.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doflamingooo!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.26,0:19:13.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He wiped out Bellamy as easily as stomping\Non a baby! He was worth 55 million!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.37,0:19:14.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.07,0:19:16.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The beginning is upon us!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.14,0:19:20.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I suggest you prepare. We're\Ndrawing close to a new world
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.42,0:19:23.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in which only true pirates can survive.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.32,0:19:27.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The weak should run while they still can,\Nor be swept away by the tides of time
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.90,0:19:30.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,as they roll back to reveal\Na New Era of Champions!
